# Cline Rules - AY Vault
# Mirrors .roorules for Roo Code / Cline interoperability

- Python 3.10+ with Tkinter desktop UI and SQLite storage in WAL mode.
- Cryptography: AES-256-GCM authenticated encryption at rest (data/vault/*.enc).
- Authentication: RFC 9106 Argon2id password hashing and 5-attempt lockout enforcement.
- Authorization: Central PolicyEngine enforcing Bell-LaPadula MLS (No Read Up) and departmental silos.
- Forensics: Tamper-evident SHA-256 hash-chained audit ledger with verification and tamper simulation.
- Disaster Recovery: Passphrase-encrypted archives (.ayb) with PBKDF2 key derivation and manifest validation.
